sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant AG as Agent (runAgent)
  participant MC as MCPClient (mcp.js)
  participant SIG as SignatureV4<br/>(service=bedrock-agentcore)
  participant GW as Gateway (MCP, AWS_IAM)
  participant LAM as Skills Lambda
  AG->>MC: init()
  MC->>SIG: sign POST (SigV4, default creds)
  MC->>GW: POST initialize (Accept: json + text/event-stream)
  GW-->>MC: result + header mcp-session-id (reused)
  MC->>GW: POST notifications/initialized
  AG->>MC: listTools()
  MC->>GW: POST tools/list
  GW-->>MC: tools[] (8 tool schemas)
  AG->>MC: callTool(name, args)
  MC->>GW: POST tools/call {name, arguments}
  GW->>LAM: invoke (clientContext.Custom.bedrockAgentCoreToolName)
  LAM-->>GW: tool result (JSON)
  GW-->>MC: result (SSE: last data: line / JSON)
  MC-->>AG: structuredContent or content[].text (parsed JSON)
